],"##Block 2 — Position measures#{1}":[127,160],"##Block 3 — Color by position":[161,175],"##Block 3 — Color by position#{1}":[163,164],"##Block 3 — Color by position#1\\. Select the chart → Format visual → Data colors.":[165,166],"##Block 3 — Color by position#2\\. You’ll see one color swatch per Position measure. Set:":[167,171],"##Block 3 — Color by position#2\\. You’ll see one color swatch per Position measure. Set:#{1}":[169,169],"##Block 3 — Color by position#2\\. You’ll see one color swatch per Position measure. Set:#{2}":[170,171],"##Block 3 — Color by position#3\\. Turn the legend off (Format visual → Legend → Show = Off).":[172,175],"##Block 3 — Color by position#3\\. Turn the legend off (Format visual → Legend → Show = Off).#{1}":[174,175],"##Wiring it up in the report":[176,196],"##Wiring it up in the report#{1}":[178,181],"##Wiring it up in the report#Build (or rebind) the chart:":[182,187],"##Wiring it up in the report#Build (or rebind) the chart:#{1}":[184,184],"##Wiring it up in the report#Build (or rebind) the chart:#{2}":[185,185],"##Wiring it up in the report#Build (or rebind) the chart:#{3}":[186,187],"##Wiring it up in the report#Add the selector slicer:":[188,192],"##Wiring it up in the report#Add the selector slicer:#{1}":[190,190],"##Wiring it up in the report#Add the selector slicer:#{2}":[191,192],"##Wiring it up in the report#Colors & legend — see Block 3 above.":[193,196],"##Wiring it up in the report#Colors & legend — see Block 3 above.#{1}":[195,196],"##Optional — a custom tooltip":[197,258],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{1}":[199,251],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{2}":[252,252],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{3}":[253,253],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{4}":[254,254],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{5}":[255,256],"##Optional — a custom tooltip#{6}":[257,258],"##Quick test checklist":[259,269],"##Quick test checklist#{1}":[261,262],"##Quick test checklist#{2}":[263,263],"##Quick test checklist#{3}":[264,264],"##Quick test checklist#{